// - @battle-node-control.mdc#Capture-System#Visual-Feedback

1. Update Timing Hierarchy:
   - Real-time (60fps): Animations, movement, visual effects
     - Use requestAnimationFrame for smooth updates
     - Implement RAF fallback for background tabs
   - Speed-based: Attack animations (per battalion speed stat)
     - Duration = 1000ms / speed stat
     - Use Animated.timing with proper easing
   - Global timer (1s): Health, damage, state synchronization
     - Align with backend update cycle
     - Buffer state changes for smooth transitions

2. Animation Quality Standards:
   - Smooth transitions for all state changes
   - Consistent visual language
   - Professional game-like effects
   - Clear feedback chain

