1. Combat Animations:
   - Attack animations sync with speed stat
     - Duration = 1000ms / speed
     - Use spring for impact
   - Damage number popups (1s fade)
     - Scale + fade combination
     - Stagger multiple hits
   - Health bar transitions (60fps)
     - Smooth color interpolation
     - Buffer rapid changes
   - Status effect overlays
     - Use composition for multiple effects
     - Clear z-index hierarchy

2. Movement Animations:
   - Position interpolation (60fps)
     - Use matrix transforms
     - Implement path following
   - Path preview transitions
     - Fade in/out with timing
     - Show valid/invalid states
   - Range indicator updates
     - Real-time circle scaling
     - Efficient circle drawing
   - Network line snapping
     - Smooth bezier transitions
     - Handle direction changes

3. State Change Animations:
   - Node capture transitions
     - Color morphing
     - Particle effects
   - Battalion state updates
     - Health color shifts
     - Status indicator changes
   - Victory point indicators
     - Score popups
     - Contribution highlights
   - Error state feedback
     - Clear visual warnings
     - Recovery animations

